/*  The rarer statements — Judge, tasks and burying, files and streams, pipes and runs, getters,
    setters, unmakers, overloads, interfaces, and Cufet held inside Cufet.

    Each is a port of the method of the same shape in `src/Interpreter/Parser.cs`.
*/

Pull a book on collections.
    /// A statement ending in `.` after one expression — `Close c.`, `Seed the chance with 7.`
    Bind node or failure to finish-with-dot unto parser, given (the node made-node):
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Cast one's consume on ("Dot") or pass the failure off.
        Return made-node.
    Done.

    // ── Judge ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

    /// ParseArmValue — literals only.
    Bind node or failure to arm-value unto parser:
        Define tok as cast one's peek.
        If tok's kind is "Minus":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define digits as cast one's peek.
            If digits's kind is not "Number":
                Return a failure (cast one's expecting on (digits, "a number after '-'")).
            Done.
            Cast one's advance.
            Define amount as (digits's lexeme converted to number) but void is 0.
            Return cast made on ("NumberLiteral", a series with (cast numeral on (0 - amount))).
        Done.
        If tok's kind is "Number":
            Cast one's advance.
            Define amount as (tok's lexeme converted to number) but void is 0.
            Return cast made on ("NumberLiteral", a series with (cast numeral on (amount))).
        Done.
        If tok's kind is "String":
            Cast one's advance.
            Return cast made on ("StringLiteral", a series with (cast quoted on (tok's lexeme))).
        Done.
        If tok's kind is "Bits":
            Cast one's advance.
            Return cast bits-literal on (tok).
        Done.
        If tok's kind is "TrueKw" or tok's kind is "FalseKw":
            Cast one's advance.
            Return cast placed on ("BooleanLiteral", a series with (cast flag on (tok's kind is "TrueKw")), tok).
        Done.
        Return a failure (cast one's expecting on (tok, "a number, some text, a bit pattern or a fact after 'It is'")).
    Done.

    Bind node or failure to judge-statement unto parser:
        Define judge-tok as cast one's advance.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define subject as cast one's expression or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        For each word in a series with ("Comma", "Where", "It", "Is", "Colon"), repeat:
            Cast one's consume on (word) or pass the failure off.
            If word is not "Colon", cast one's skip-noise.
        Done.
        Define arms as cast listed.
        Define otherwise-body as cast nothing.
        Define scanning as true.
        While scanning, repeat:
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define kind as cast one's peek-kind.
            If kind is "Done" or kind is "Eof", stop.
            If kind is "Otherwise":
                Define default-tok as cast one's advance.
                The otherwise-body becomes cast one's if-body on (default-tok) or pass the failure off.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Stop.
            Done.
            Define arm-tok as cast one's peek.
            If kind is "It":
                Cast one's advance.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Cast one's consume on ("Is") or pass the failure off.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Define values as cast listed.
                Define first-value as cast one's arm-value or pass the failure off.
                Cast values's add on (first-value).
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                While cast one's peek-kind is "Or", repeat:
                    Cast one's advance.
                    Cast one's skip-noise.
                    Define next-value as cast one's arm-value or pass the failure off.
                    Cast values's add on (next-value).
                    Cast one's skip-noise.
                Done.
                Define value-body as cast one's if-body on (arm-tok) or pass the failure off.
                Define value-arm as cast placed on ("JudgeArm", a series with (cast listed, value-body), arm-tok).
                Cast value-arm's add on (values).
                Cast arms's add on (value-arm).
                Skip.
            Done.
            Define cases as cast listed.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define first-case as cast one's type-annotation or pass the failure off.
            Cast cases's add on (first-case).
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            While cast one's peek-kind is "Or", repeat:
                Cast one's advance.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Define next-case as cast one's type-annotation or pass the failure off.
                Cast cases's add on (next-case).
                Cast one's skip-noise.
            Done.
            Define case-body as cast one's if-body on (arm-tok) or pass the failure off.
            Define case-arm as cast placed on ("JudgeArm", a series with (cases, case-body), arm-tok).
            Cast case-arm's add on (cast nothing).
            Cast arms's add on (case-arm).
        Done.
        Cast one's consume on ("Done") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's consume on ("Dot") or pass the failure off.
        If the number of arms's children is 0:
            Return a failure (cast one's expecting on (judge-tok, "at least one case in a Judge")).
        Done.
        Return cast placed on ("JudgeStatement", a series with (subject, arms, otherwise-body), judge-tok).
    Done.

    // ── Tasks, channels, burying, interrupts ──────────────────────────────

    Bind node or failure to have-statement unto parser:
        Define have-tok as cast one's advance.
        Define rabbit-name as cast nothing.
        Define here as cast one's peek.
        If here's kind is "Identifier" and cast spelled on (here, "rabbit"):
            Cast one's advance.
        Done.
        Otherwise:
            Define named as cast one's consume on ("Identifier") or pass the failure off.
            The rabbit-name becomes cast quoted on (named's lexeme).
        Done.
        If cast one's peek-kind is "Bury":
            If one's function-depth is 0:
                Return a failure (cast one's refused on (have-tok, "'bury' is only meaningful inside a function — it is what makes that function hand "
                    joined to "back a stash. At the top level there is nothing to suspend.")).
            Done.
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define value as cast one's expression or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Cast one's consume on ("Dot") or pass the failure off.
            Define bury-node as cast placed on ("BuryStatement", a series with (value), have-tok).
            Cast bury-node's add on (rabbit-name).
            Return bury-node.
        Done.
        If one's rabbit-depth is 0:
            Return a failure (cast one's refused on (have-tok,
                "'Have rabbit start a task' requires an active rabbit — wrap it in 'Pull a rabbit. ... Done.'")).
        Done.
        Cast one's consume on ("Start") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Cast one's consume on ("TaskKw") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define task-name as cast nothing.
        If cast one's peek-kind is "As":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define name-tok as cast one's consume on ("Identifier") or pass the failure off.
            The task-name becomes cast quoted on (name-tok's lexeme).
            Cast one's skip-noise.
        Done.
        Increment one's function-depth by 1.
        Define body as cast listed.
        If cast one's peek-kind is "Comma":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define single as cast one's statement or pass the failure off.
            Cast body's add on (single).
        Done.
        Otherwise:
            Cast one's consume on ("Colon") or pass the failure off.
            The body becomes cast one's pull-body on (cast listed) or pass the failure off.
        Done.
        Decrement one's function-depth by 1.
        Define launch as cast placed on ("LaunchTaskStatement", a series with (task-name, body), have-tok).
        Cast launch's add on (rabbit-name).
        Return launch.
    Done.

    // ── Files and streams ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

    Bind node or failure to write-statement unto parser:
        Define write-tok as cast one's advance.
        Define appending as write-tok's kind is "Append".
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define value as cast one's expression or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Cast one's consume on ("To") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        If cast one's peek-kind is "File":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define path-expr as cast one's expr-or or pass the failure off.
            Define file-write as cast placed on ("FileWriteStatement", a series with (cast flag on (appending), value, path-expr), write-tok).
            Return cast one's finish-with-dot on (file-write) or pass the failure off.
        Done.
        If appending:
            Return a failure (cast one's refused on (cast one's peek, "expected 'the file \"path\"' after 'append <value> to'")).
        Done.
        Define stream-expr as cast one's expr-or or pass the failure off.
        Return cast one's finish-with-dot on (cast placed on ("WriteToStreamStatement", a series with (value, stream-expr), write-tok))
            or pass the failure off.
    Done.

    Bind node or failure to with-open unto parser:
        Define with-tok as cast one's advance.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Cast one's consume on ("File") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define path-expr as cast one's expr-or or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Cast one's consume on ("Open") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Cast one's consume on ("For") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define mode as "".
        If cast one's peek-kind is "Identifier" and cast one's is-word on ("reading"), the mode becomes "Reading".
        If cast one's peek-kind is "Identifier" and cast one's is-word on ("writing"), the mode becomes "Writing".
        If mode is "":
            Return a failure (cast one's expecting on (cast one's peek, "'reading' or 'writing' after 'for'")).
        Done.
        Cast one's advance.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Cast one's consume on ("As") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define binding-tok as cast one's consume on ("Identifier") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Cast one's consume on ("Colon") or pass the failure off.
        Increment one's nest-depth by 1.
        Define body as cast one's loop-body on (with-tok, "", "", "") or pass the failure off.
        Decrement one's nest-depth by 1.
        Return cast placed on ("WithOpenStatement", a series with (cast atom on (mode), path-expr,
            cast quoted on (binding-tok's lexeme), body), with-tok).
    Done.

    // ── Pipes and runs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

    Bind node or failure to pipe-statement unto parser:
        Define start-tok as cast one's peek.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define left as cast one's expr-or or pass the failure off.
        If cast one's peek-kind is not "Pipe":
            If left's kind is not "RunExpression":
                Return a failure (cast one's expecting on (cast one's peek, "'|' — a pipe stage that is not a `run` must be piped to something")).
            Done.
            If (item 6 of left's children)'s word is "true":
                Return a failure (cast refused-at on (cast numeral-value on (item 4 of left's children),
                    cast numeral-value on (item 5 of left's children),
                    "'with the terminal' asks for the child's exit code, and a statement has "
                    joined to "nowhere to put it. Write `Define <name> as run ... with the terminal.` to "
                    joined to "keep the exit code, or `Run ...` on its own to hand over the terminal and "
                    joined to "ignore it.")).
            Done.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Cast one's consume on ("Dot") or pass the failure off.
            Return cast made on ("RunStatement", a series with (item 1 of left's children, item 2 of left's children,
                item 3 of left's children, item 4 of left's children, item 5 of left's children)).
        Done.
        While cast one's peek-kind is "Pipe", repeat:
            Define pipe-tok as cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define right as cast one's expr-or or pass the failure off.
            The left becomes cast placed on ("PipeExpression", a series with (left, right), pipe-tok).
        Done.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Cast one's consume on ("Dot") or pass the failure off.
        Return left.
    Done.

    // ── Declarations beside objects ───────────────────────────────────────

    /// `unto <type>` — a filled generic target is not taught yet.
    Bind node or failure to unto-target unto parser:
        Define target-tok as cast one's consume on ("Identifier") or pass the failure off.
        If cast one's peek-kind is "Of", return a failure (cast one's not-yet on ("unto a filled generic")).
        Return cast quoted on (target-tok's lexeme).
    Done.

    Bind node or failure to getter-declaration unto parser:
        Define saved-object-def as one's in-object-def.
        Define saved-free-function as one's in-free-function.
        One's in-object-def becomes false.
        One's in-free-function becomes false.
        Define get-tok as cast one's advance.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define name-tok as cast one's consume on ("Identifier") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define unto-name as cast nothing.
        If cast one's peek-kind is "Unto":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            The unto-name becomes cast one's unto-target or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
        Done.
        Cast one's consume on ("As") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define returned as cast one's return-type or pass the failure off.
        If returned's word is "_":
            Return a failure (cast one's expecting on (cast one's peek, "a return type — getters cannot be void")).
        Done.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Increment one's function-depth by 1.
        Define body as cast one's value-body on (get-tok, "Get doubled unto box as number, one's n * 2.", "") or pass the failure off.
        Decrement one's function-depth by 1.
        One's in-object-def becomes saved-object-def.
        One's in-free-function becomes saved-free-function.
        Return cast placed on ("GetterDeclaration", a series with (cast quoted on (name-tok's lexeme), returned, body, unto-name), get-tok).
    Done.

    Bind node or failure to setter-declaration unto parser:
        Define saved-object-def as one's in-object-def.
        Define saved-free-function as one's in-free-function.
        One's in-object-def becomes false.
        One's in-free-function becomes false.
        Define set-tok as cast one's advance.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define name-tok as cast one's consume on ("Identifier") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define unto-name as cast nothing.
        If cast one's peek-kind is "Unto":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            The unto-name becomes cast one's unto-target or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
        Done.
        Cast one's consume on ("Given") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Cast one's consume on ("LParen") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define taken as cast one's parameter or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Cast one's consume on ("RParen") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Increment one's function-depth by 1.
        Define body as cast one's void-body on (set-tok, "Set bump unto box given (the number v), one's n becomes v.", "") or pass the failure off.
        Decrement one's function-depth by 1.
        One's in-object-def becomes saved-object-def.
        One's in-free-function becomes saved-free-function.
        Return cast placed on ("SetterDeclaration", a series with (cast quoted on (name-tok's lexeme),
            item 1 of taken's children, item 2 of taken's children, body, unto-name), set-tok).
    Done.

    Bind node or failure to unmaker-declaration unto parser:
        If one's nest-depth is greater than 0:
            Return a failure (cast one's refused on (cast one's peek, "unmakers must be declared at the top level, not inside a block")).
        Done.
        Define saved-object-def as one's in-object-def.
        Define saved-free-function as one's in-free-function.
        One's in-object-def becomes false.
        One's in-free-function becomes false.
        Define bind-tok as cast one's advance.
        Cast one's consume on ("UnmakingKw") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define type-tok as cast one's consume on ("Identifier") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Cast one's consume on ("To") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define name-tok as cast one's consume on ("Identifier") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        If cast one's peek-kind is "Given":
            Return a failure (cast one's refused on (cast one's peek, "unmakers take no parameters — omit 'given (...)' entirely")).
        Done.
        Increment one's function-depth by 1.
        Define body as cast one's void-body on (bind-tok, "Bind unmaking a handle to release, State \"closed\".", "Bind unmaking") or pass the failure off.
        Decrement one's function-depth by 1.
        One's in-object-def becomes saved-object-def.
        One's in-free-function becomes saved-free-function.
        Return cast placed on ("UnmakerDeclaration", a series with (cast quoted on (name-tok's lexeme),
            cast quoted on (type-tok's lexeme), body), bind-tok).
    Done.

    Bind node or failure to overload-operand unto parser:
        Define tok as cast one's peek.
        Define lowered as tok's lexeme in lowercase.
        Define built-in as lowered is "number" or lowered is "text" or lowered is "fact" or lowered is "bits".
        If tok's kind is not "Identifier" and built-in is false:
            Return a failure (cast one's expecting on (tok, "a type name for this operand")).
        Done.
        Cast one's advance.
        Return cast quoted on (tok's lexeme).
    Done.

    Bind node or failure to overload-declaration unto parser:
        If one's nest-depth is greater than 0:
            Return a failure (cast one's refused on (cast one's peek, "operator overloads must be declared at the top level, not inside a block")).
        Done.
        Define saved-object-def as one's in-object-def.
        Define saved-free-function as one's in-free-function.
        One's in-object-def becomes false.
        One's in-free-function becomes false.
        Define bind-tok as cast one's advance.
        Cast one's consume on ("OverloadingKw") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define op-tok as cast one's peek.
        Define op as op-tok's kind.
        If op is not "Plus" and op is not "Minus" and op is not "Star" and op is not "Slash":
            Return a failure (cast one's refused on (op-tok, "expected an arithmetic operator (+, -, *, /) after 'overloading'")).
        Done.
        Cast one's advance.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        If cast one's peek-kind is "Comma", cast one's advance.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Cast one's consume on ("Given") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Cast one's consume on ("LParen") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define left-tok as cast one's consume on ("Identifier") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Cast one's consume on ("Is") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define left-type as cast one's overload-operand or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Cast one's consume on ("Comma") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define right-tok as cast one's consume on ("Identifier") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Cast one's consume on ("Is") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define right-type as cast one's overload-operand or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Cast one's consume on ("RParen") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Increment one's function-depth by 1.
        Define body as cast one's value-body on (bind-tok, "Bind overloading +, given (the lhs is a vec, the rhs is a vec), a new vec \{ the x lhs's x + rhs's x \}.", "Bind overloading") or pass the failure off.
        Decrement one's function-depth by 1.
        One's in-object-def becomes saved-object-def.
        One's in-free-function becomes saved-free-function.
        Return cast placed on ("OperatorOverloadDeclaration", a series with (cast atom on (op),
            cast quoted on (left-tok's lexeme), cast quoted on (right-tok's lexeme), left-type, right-type, body), bind-tok).
    Done.

    // ── Interfaces ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

    Bind node or failure to interface-method unto parser:
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define returned as cast nothing.
        If cast one's peek-kind is "Void":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
        Done.
        Otherwise:
            The returned becomes cast one's type-annotation or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
        Done.
        Cast one's consume on ("FunctionKw") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define name-tok as cast one's consume on ("Identifier") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define parameter-types as cast listed.
        Define following as cast one's token-at on (one's at + 1).
        If cast one's peek-kind is "Comma" and following's kind is "Given":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Cast one's consume on ("Given") or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Cast one's consume on ("LParen") or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            If cast one's peek-kind is not "RParen":
                Define first-parameter as cast one's parameter or pass the failure off.
                Cast parameter-types's add on (item 1 of first-parameter's children).
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                While cast one's peek-kind is "Comma", repeat:
                    Cast one's advance.
                    Cast one's skip-noise.
                    Define next-parameter as cast one's parameter or pass the failure off.
                    Cast parameter-types's add on (item 1 of next-parameter's children).
                    Cast one's skip-noise.
                Done.
            Done.
            Cast one's consume on ("RParen") or pass the failure off.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
        Done.
        Define method as cast listed.
        Cast method's add on (cast quoted on (name-tok's lexeme)).
        Cast method's add on (returned).
        Cast method's add on (parameter-types).
        Return method.
    Done.

    Bind node or failure to interface-definition unto parser, given (the token name-tok, the token define-tok):
        Cast one's consume on ("Interface") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Cast one's consume on ("For") or pass the failure off.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Define methods as cast listed.
        If cast one's peek-kind is "LBrace":
            Cast one's advance.
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            Define first-method as cast one's interface-method or pass the failure off.
            Cast methods's add on (first-method).
            Cast one's skip-noise.
            While cast one's peek-kind is "Comma", repeat:
                Cast one's advance.
                Cast one's skip-noise.
                Define next-method as cast one's interface-method or pass the failure off.
                Cast methods's add on (next-method).
                Cast one's skip-noise.
            Done.
            Cast one's consume on ("RBrace") or pass the failure off.
        Done.
        Otherwise:
            Define only-method as cast one's interface-method or pass the failure off.
            Cast methods's add on (only-method).
        Done.
        Cast one's skip-noise.
        Cast one's consume on ("Dot") or pass the failure off.
        Return cast placed on ("InterfaceDefinition", a series with (cast quoted on (name-tok's lexeme), methods), define-tok).
    Done.

    // ── Cufet held inside Cufet ───────────────────────────────────────────

    /// The statements a `cufet` block holds, parsed where the block actually sits: its tokens are
    /// moved down to the block's line, and the first line's across to just past the `[`.
    Bind node or failure to held-cufet unto parser, given (the token source, the fact as-body):
        Define inner-tokens as cast tokens-of on (source's lexeme) or pass the failure off.
        Define moved as a series of token.
        For each inner in inner-tokens, repeat:
            Define shifted-column as inner's column.
            If inner's row is 1, the shifted-column becomes inner's column + source's column.
            Insert a new token { the kind inner's kind, the lexeme inner's lexeme,
                the row inner's row + source's row - 1, the column shifted-column } into moved.
        Done.
        Define inner-parser as a new parser {
            the tokens moved, the at 1, the type-depth 0, the collections-depth 0, the loop-depth 0,
            the nest-depth 0, the function-depth 0, the rabbit-depth 0, the in-object-def false, the in-free-function false }.
        If as-body:
            The inner-parser's function-depth becomes 1.
            The inner-parser's in-free-function becomes true.
        Done.
        Define statements as cast listed.
        Define scanning as true.
        While scanning, repeat:
            Cast inner-parser's skip-noise.
            If cast inner-parser's peek-kind is "Eof", stop.
            Define inner-statement as cast inner-parser's statement or pass the failure off.
            Cast statements's add on (inner-statement).
        Done.
        Return cast expand-defaults on (statements) or pass the failure off.
    Done.
Done.
